  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「ど、どうしよう……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「うう。楽器って、壊れたらどうやって直せばいいんだろ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「とりあえずガムテープで折れたところ、くっつけてみたけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「こんなんじゃ駄目だよね、『その場しのぎ』にもならない～！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「すず先輩のギターだったらどうしよ、怒られちゃう！　嫌われちゃうよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「ううん。誰のギターでも駄目だ、しずくちゃんもドラムに勝手に触ったりしたら怒るもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「『自分のいちぶ』なんだろうなぁ、それを勝手に触って壊しちゃったんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「でもでも、最初にギターに触ったの長町さんだもん！　ぼくは悪くない！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「ううん、『長町さんのせい』にしちゃいけないよね……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「どうしよう？　『見なかったこと』にしたいっ、こっそり元の場所に戻して……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「誰かが気づいても『知らんぷり』して、『いつの間にか壊れてた』ってことにすれば～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「いやいや、駄目だ！　ぼく嘘は苦手だし、いつかばれる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「ギターを壊したうえに嘘ついて『知らんぷり』してたってわかったら、もっと怒られる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「軽音部を、追いだされちゃうかも……。ただでさえ、ぼく歌も楽器もできなくて役立たずなのに！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「さらに迷惑かけちゃったら、居場所がなくなっちゃうよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「どうしよう……こんなこと、しずくちゃんやすず先輩には相談できないし～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「……ひうっ!?」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「だ、誰っ？　誰かが部室に入ってきた！　しずくちゃん？　すず先輩？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「ごめんなさいごめんなさいっ、ぼくは悪くないの！　ぜんぶ運命っていうか、神さまが悪くて～っ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「あれっ、転校生の……先輩？　な、何でここに？　か、勝手に軽音部の部室に入ってこないでよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「あんたはすず先輩の『お気に入り』だから、嫌いだ～！　ぼ、ぼくの敵だもん！　がるるる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「……な、何とか言ってください。無言で『じっ』と見られてると落ちつかないよ～、怖いよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「うう？　そうです、ギターが壊れちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「み、見たな？　も、もも、目撃者は消しちゃう？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「ふぇ？　ほんとだ、ぼくのスマホが着信してる！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「だ、誰からのお電話だろ？　知らない番号だけど……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「えっと、もしもし！　月永です～、そうです君咲学院の軽音部ですけど～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「はい、はい……。えぇっと、楽器屋さん？　あぁ、楽器のメンテが終わったんですね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「そっか。楽器のメンテを頼んだときに、ぼくの番号を書いたっけ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「えっ、引き取りに？　どうしよ、大雨だし……。ぼくだけじゃ、楽器を濡らさずに運ぶのは無理だよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「はうっ、何？　話しかけないで転校生のひとっ、電話ちゅうだから！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「あぁ、そうですね？　壊れたギター、楽器屋さんに頼んで修理してもらえばいいんだ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「楽器を引き取りにいく、『ついで』に！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「かしこ～い！　えへへ、ナイスアドバイスです先輩♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「はい、そうです。ギターが壊れちゃって……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「あっ、わかりました！　すぐ届けに行きますっ、よろしくお願いしま～す♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「……はふう。どうにか、命綱が切れずに済んだ感じ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「そうだよね、誰にも知られないうちに『こっそり』修理しちゃえばいいんだ！　え、えへへ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「……あれっ、まだいたんですか転校生のひと。あの～、軽音部に何か用事だったんですか？」"
