  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「え？　壊れたギター、運んでくれるの？　ついでに、メンテが終わった楽器を引き取るのも手伝う……って？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「いやいや、そんな迷惑をかけるわけには！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「先輩は、軽音部と何の関係もないし……。手伝ってもらう、理由がないです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「だから結構ですっ、どっか行って！　助言してくれたことには、感謝してあげるけど～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「はう!?　な、何っ？　急に動かないでっ、ビックリしちゃうよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「え？　窓の外……が、どうかしたんですか？　何が見えるのっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 28,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 22,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るか",
    "text": "「わわっ、抱っこしないで！　そんなふうにしなくても見えるもんっ、そこまで『ちび』じゃないから！」"
